              "id": "1765703405641_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate the final response for a successful tactic creation.\n\n  Context:\n  - Tactic name: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_TACTIC_PAYLOAD.$output.result.TacticName}}\n  - Tactic id: {{$context.$nodes.GET_TACTIC_ID.$output.result}}\n  - Program id: {{$context.$variables.programId}}\n  - Launch action: {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_PROGRAM_DATA.$output.result.Action}}\n\n  Output exactly one <oraInfoDisplay> block followed by one <oraImmediateInsight> block.\n\n  Use this exact structure, replacing only the context values:\n\n  <oraInfoDisplay key=\"unique-{{$context.$nodes.GET_TACTIC_ID.$output.result}}\">\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Tactic {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_TACTIC_PAYLOAD.$output.result.TacticName}} Created\",\n    \"patternId\": \"cardWidget\",\n    \"description\": \"Notification of tactic creation\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"subject\": \"Tactic {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_TACTIC_PAYLOAD.$output.result.TacticName}} created.\",\n      \"summary\": \"Tactic {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_TACTIC_PAYLOAD.$output.result.TacticName}} created.\",\n      \"badgeText\": \"Success\",\n      \"variant\": \"success\",\n      \"link\": {\n        \"text\": \"Configure Tactic\",\n        \"action\": \"ora.Invoke(\\\"{{$context.$nodes.REFINE_PROGRAM_DATA.$output.result.Action}}\\\", {\\\"TacticId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$nodes.GET_TACTIC_ID.$output.result}}\\\", \\\"ProgramId\\\":\\\"{{$context.$variables.programId}}\\\"})\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  </oraInfoDisplay>\n  <oraImmediateInsight>\n  { \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\\\"refresh\\\")\" }\n  </oraImmediateInsight>\n\n  Hard constraints:\n  - Output only the <oraInfoDisplay> block and the <oraImmediateInsight> block.\n  - Do not output markdown, bullets, explanations, or any text outside the two blocks.\n  - Do not change the link text.\n  - Do not change the action parameter names: \"TacticId\" and \"ProgramId\".\n  - Use the launch action from {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_PROGRAM_DATA.$output.result.Action}} exactly.\n"
            },
