            {
              "id": "1765695234366_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Program details (use program name + description): `{{$context.$nodes.GET_PROGRAM_DETAILS.$output}}`\n\n\nGenerate a messageListWidget using below combined tactic templates data `{{$context.$nodes.COMBINE_TACTIC_TEMPLATES.$output.result}}`\n \ntitle: template name\nsummary: <templateDescription>\nbadgeText: \"Add to Program\" (must be exactly this value)\npriority: \"medium\" (must be exactly this value)\naction: ora.Invoke(createTactic, createTactic(templateId=<templateId>))\n\nWhere:\n\n<templateId> = Use the Id from the tactic template data for each item.\n<templateDescription> - Generate a precise one line sentence based on the description attribute for the current row\n\n\n\nWidget title: Generate a short title directing end user to create tactic based on recommendations. Provide one line description on how these tactic are recommendation and how it can help in achieving the program objective. For title and description make sure these are recommendation for tactic not for tactic template."
            }
          ],
