              "value": "Generate a clear and informative message to the user indicating that the Tactic Creation has failed.\nExplain that a possible cause could be the presence of duplicate tactic attributes already existing in the system.\nAdvise the user to recreate the tactic with correct and unique tactic details to avoid this issue.\nEnsure the message is polite, concise, and guides the user on the next steps to resolve the problem."
