              "value": "Generate a clear and informative message to the user indicating that the Tactic Creation has failed during the stage processing.\nExplain that a possible cause could be the presence issue in the stage data.\nAdvise the user to recreate the tactic with correct data.\nEnsure the message is polite, concise, and guides the user on the next steps to resolve the problem."
