          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1782135634929_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Render one error cardWidget followed by one editable recordWidget so the user can correct the tactic name and resubmit."
            },
            {
              "id": "1782135634929_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate the final response for a failed tactic creation attempt.\n\n  Context:\n  - The tactic creation BO call failed.\n  - Most likely cause: the tactic name is not unique.\n  - Tactic name: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_TACTIC_PAYLOAD.$output.result.TacticName}}\n  - Tactic objective: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_TACTIC_PAYLOAD.$output.result.TacticObjective}}\n  - Template id: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_TACTIC_PAYLOAD.$output.result.TemplateId}}\n\n  Output exactly two <oraInfoDisplay> blocks and nothing else.\n\n  Block 1: error card\n  Use this exact structure:\n  <oraInfoDisplay key=\"error-unique-tactic-name\">\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Resubmit Tactic Details\",\n    \"patternId\": \"cardWidget\",\n    \"description\": \"The chosen tactic name is already in use. Please use a different tactic name.\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"subject\": \"Tactic name already exists\",\n      \"summary\": <leave empty>,\n      \"badgeText\": \"Action Required\",\n      \"statusPriority\": \"alert\",\n      \"variant\": \"error\"\n    }\n  }\n  </oraInfoDisplay>\n\n  Block 2: editable resubmit form\n  Use this exact structure, replacing only the context values:\n  <oraInfoDisplay key=\"templateId_<TemplateId>\">\n  {\n    \"title\": <leave empty>,\n    \"patternId\": \"recordWidget\",\n    \"description\": <leave empty>,\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"id\": \"templateId_<TemplateId>\",\n      \"readOnly\": false,\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"TacticName\",\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"label\": \"Tactic Name\",\n          \"value\": \"<TacticName>\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"TacticObjective\",\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"label\": \"Tactic Objective\",\n          \"value\": \"<TacticObjective>\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n  </oraInfoDisplay>\n\n  Replacement rules:\n  - Replace <TemplateId> with {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_TACTIC_PAYLOAD.$output.result.TemplateId}}\n  - Replace <TacticName> with {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_TACTIC_PAYLOAD.$output.result.TacticName}}\n  - Replace <TacticObjective> with {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_TACTIC_PAYLOAD.$output.result.TacticObjective}}\n  - The key and properties.id in Block 2 must both be exactly \"templateId_<TemplateId>\" after replacement.\n\n  Hard constraints:\n  - Output only the two <oraInfoDisplay> blocks.\n  - Do not output markdown, bullets, explanations, or any text outside the two blocks.\n  - Do not change the field ids: they must remain exactly \"TacticName\" and \"TacticObjective\".\n  - Do not add or remove fields.\n"
            }
          ],
